	"_20m inverted vee, using formulas and variables"							
	_0	_0	_=H	_0	_=L * SIN(RADIANS(A/2))	_=H - L *  COS(RADIANS(A/2))	_#12	"_=CEILING(WireLen / WL * 20, 1)"
