	_New users:							
	"_This is model ""Vee With Formulas.weq"".  The model name is shown at the top of the Excel window."							
	_To see what the antenna looks like first make sure EZNEC is already open in a separate window							
	"_then click the AutoEZ ""View Ant"" button (above, top center).  The EZNEC View Antenna window"							
	_will appear.  To return to AutoEZ click anywhere on the AutoEZ/Excel window or click the			
	_AutoEZ/Excel icon in the taskbar.			

	_This model is similar to EZNEC sample BYVEE.ez except that variables are used to control the 			
	"_apex angle, the apex height, and the leg length.  For example, click on cell G11 to see how"			
	"_""H"" (apex height), ""L"" (leg length), and ""A"" (apex angle) are used to define the Z coordinate"			
	_for End 2 (the outer end) of Wire 1.			

	"_The current values for ""H"", ""L"", and ""A"" are set on the Variables sheet tab."			
